export anchor NightLettersStyle:
    number: 396
    screen: EmailClient
    name: Night letters
    idea: Mail as real paper post on a midnight desk under one warm lamp, with messages as envelopes sealed in wax until read and the open message laid out as a letter on dim warm paper.
    base: dark
    palette:
        night: #10121c, the room behind everything
        desk: #161926, drawers, secondary buttons and the style sheet
        envelope: #2a2c3a, message envelopes and ribbon tags
        envelopeEdge: #3d4052, envelope borders and the flap lines
        paper: #2b251c, the open letter sheet
        paperEdge: #4a3f2e, the letter border and its header rule
        ink: #f1e7d2, text
        dim: #c2b8a5, subjects, meta and postmarks
        lamp: #f4c374, the glow, the open envelope edge, the Reply button and focus
        onLamp: #2b1a02, text on lamp
        wax: #d9675a, the seal on unread envelopes beside the words
        blueInk: #a9c1ff, the handwritten signature
    type:
        A book serif, Iowan Old Style, Palatino Linotype, Palatino, Book
        Antiqua, Georgia, for everything at a 16px base. The letter subject
        is 30px italic, the letter body 19px at 1.8, senders 18px with
        unread ones at 700, subjects italic. The signature Dana uses a
        script stack, Segoe Script, Apple Chancery, URW Chancery L, cursive,
        at 28px in blue ink.
    layout:
        The top of the page is lit by a soft radial lamp glow from the top
        right, with a small drawn lampshade hanging there. The header holds
        Brightwork in bold and Mail in italic, the folders as small drawer
        fronts each with a round knob, Inbox 12 edged in lamp gold, and the
        labels as notched ribbon tags with a coloured stripe. Below, a left
        column titled The evening post, six letters stacks six envelopes,
        each tilted half a degree the other way from the last, with two
        faint diagonal flap lines, the sender, the subject in italic, an
        optional quoted snippet, state words and a dashed round postmark
        holding the time at the right. The Northpass envelope is ringed in
        lamp gold. The right column, titled Open on the blotter, shows the
        letter on dim warm paper turned slightly, with From, To and Sent
        in its header, the subject in italic, the body, Thanks on its own
        line and Dana in blue script, then a Clients ribbon. Square cornered
        buttons sit under the sheet with Reply in lamp gold. Below 1000px
        the letter moves under the stack, and on a phone the drawers scroll
        sideways.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 14px between envelopes, 48px between the stack and the letter, 48 by 56px inside the letter.
    density: Low to medium. Six envelopes and one letter.
    corners: 4px envelopes, 2px paper, 3px drawers and buttons, round postmarks and seals.
    borders: 1px envelope edge, flap lines drawn as two diagonals, dashed round postmarks.
    shadows: Long soft drop shadows under envelopes and the letter, plus the radial lamp glow.
    icons:
        Few. A red wax seal plus Sealed, unread. An open envelope plus
        Opened. A clip plus Enclosure. A filled gold star plus Starred.
        Ribbon tags carry label names beside a colour stripe.
    focus: A 2px dashed lamp gold outline offset 4px.
    tone: Gently old fashioned, such as The evening post, Open on the blotter and Enclosure.
